><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Little Bowl of Myrrh\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Little_Bowl_of_Myrrh_c3850d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.40.5409<br/>July 25, 2017<br/>Summer Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Caverna Exanima</b> is an excavation site of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Museum%20of%20Tibian%20Arts\">Museum of Tibian Arts</a>. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Putrid%20Mummy\">Putrid Mummies</a> that lurk there drop valuable <a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Products\">Creature Products</a>, making this area an excellent source of profit.\n</p><p>Keep in mind that <a href=\"#/wiki/Putrid%20Mummy\">Putrid Mummies</a> can often paralyze and hit heavily when in groups. The spawn is very sparse and everything is covered in sand, so paladins and mages have a lot of space for running. It is advised to always keep your distance and fight only 2-3 at a time, as otherwise you may not be able to cure paralysis fast enough. As none of the creatures in the cave walk over fire, keep a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb%20Rune\">fire bomb</a> ready for emergencies.\n</p><p>The mummies walk slowly over sand, but they're actually pretty fast on rock soil. Know your speed breakpoints on sand for extra advantage: 196, 238, and 304 being the most important.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\"><img alt=\"Bonebeast\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bonebeast_72f853.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeast</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">580</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">515</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">342+ (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">200 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">95 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">47+ <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-90× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bone\">Bone</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Skull%20%28Item%29\">Skull (Item)</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Armor\">Plate Armor</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Bony Tail (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bone%20Club\">Bone Club</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Bone Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Mushroom\">Green Mushroom</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hardened%20Bone\">Hardened Bone</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast%20Trophy\">Bonebeast Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:Fi