a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">78 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>) + <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">44 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Summons\"><img alt=\"Summons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Player_Summon_dc8280.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-195× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-12× <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Armor\">Plate Armor</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Legs\">Plate Legs</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Two%20Handed%20Sword\">Two Handed Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Silk\">Spider Silk</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight%20Armor\">Knight Armor</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Knight Legs (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Time%20Ring\">Time Ring</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Lightning Headband (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Amulet\">Platinum Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":[]}